    "function": "Possible cargo protein of a type 1 encapsulin nanocompartment involved in protection against oxidative stress (Probable). Catalyzes the conversion of 7,8-dihydroneopterin to 6-hydroxymethyl-7,8-dihydropterin, 7,8-dihydromonapterin and 7,8-dihydroxanthopterin, respectively, in equal quantities. After longer incubation times the only product is 6-hydroxymethyl-7,8-dihydropterin. Retains aldolase activity when encapsulated with a slight decrease in rate. It is not known if this protein is normally found in the encapsulin nanocompartment",
